},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"string"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"properties","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Properties"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"expiresat","children":[{"type":"text","value":"expiresAt?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional expiresAt?: number;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/files/adapter.ts#L62","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/activities/files/adapter.ts:62"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Expiry as epoch milliseconds when the handle is scheduled to expire."}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"filename","children":[{"type":"text","value":"filename?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional filename?: string;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/files/adapter.ts#L64","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/activities/files/adapter.ts:64"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Original filename when the provider reports it."}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"id","children":[{"type":"text","value":"id"}]},{"type":"code","value":"id: string;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/files/adapter.ts#L48","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/activities/files/adapter.ts:48"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Provider handle used for lifecycle operations ("},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"get"},{"type":"text","value":"/"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"delete"},{"type":"text","value":"): the\nOpenAI/Anthropic "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"file_id"},{"type":"text","value":", the Gemini file resource name ("},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"files/..."},{"type":"text","value":"), or\nthe fal storage URL (fal itself has no lifecycle API — the URL doubles as\nthe wire reference)."}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"mimetype","children":[{"type":"text","value":"mimeType?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional mimeType?: string;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/files/adapter.ts#L58","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/activities/files/adapter.ts:58"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"MIME type reported by the provider (or echoed from the upload input)."}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"provider","children":[{"type":"text","value":"provider"}]},{"type":"code","value":"provider: TProvider;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/files/adapter.ts#L50","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/activities/files/adapter.ts:50"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The provider that issued the handle ("},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"'openai'"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"'gemini'"},{"type":"text","value":", ...)."}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"sizebytes","children":[{"type":"text","value":"sizeBytes?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional sizeBytes?: number;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/files/adapter.ts#L60","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/activities/files/adapter.ts:60"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"File size in bytes when the provider reports it."}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"uri","children":[{"type":"text","value":"uri?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional uri?: string;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/files/adapter.ts#L56","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/activities/files/adapter.ts:56"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The handle's URL form when the provider exposes one (Gemini file URI, fal\nstorage URL). For providers whose handle is an opaque id (OpenAI,\nAnthropic) this is "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"undefined"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tprovider","text":"TProvider","level":3},{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2},{"id":"expiresat","text":"expiresAt?","level":3},{"id":"filename","text":"filename?","level":3},{"id":"id","text":"id","level":3},{"id":"mimetype","text":"mimeType?","level":3},{"id":"provider","text":"provider","level":3},{"id":"sizebytes","text":"sizeBytes?","level":3},{"id":"uri","text":"uri?","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/files/adapter.ts:41](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/files/adapter.ts#L41)\n\nA provider-issued file handle returned by [FilesAdapter.upload](FilesAdapter.md#upload) /\n[FilesAdapter.get](FilesAdapter.md#get). Reference it in a message via a `{ type: 'file' }`\ncontent source — use `fileSourceFromHandle` to build one.\n\n`TProvider` carries the issuing provider's name as a literal (`'openai'`,\n`'gemini'`, ...) when the handle came from a concrete files adapter, so\ncross-provider lifecycle calls (`deleteFile` with a foreign handle) fail at\ncompile time. It defaults to `string` so wire-deserialized handles still fit.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TProvider\n\n`TProvider` *extends* `string` = `string`\n\n## Properties\n\n### expiresAt?\n\n```ts\noptional expiresAt?: number;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/files/adapter.ts:62](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/files/adapter.ts#L62)\n\nExpiry as epoch milliseconds when the handle is scheduled to expire.\n\n***\n\n### filename?\n\n```ts\noptional filename?: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/files/adapter.ts:64](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/files/adapter.ts#L64)\n\nOriginal filename when the provider reports it.\n\n***\n\n### id\n\n```ts\nid: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/files/adapter.ts:48](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/files/adapter.ts#L48)\n\nProvider handle used for lifecycle operations (`get`/`delete`): the\nOpenAI/Anthropic `file_id`, the Gemini file resource name (`files/...`), or\nthe fal storage URL (fal itself has no lifecycle API — the URL doubles as\nthe wire reference).\n\n***\n\n### mimeType?\n\n```ts\noptional mimeType?: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/files/adapter.ts:58](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/files/adapter.ts#L58)\n\nMIME type reported by the provider (or echoed from the upload input).\n\n***\n\n### provider\n\n```ts\nprovider: TProvider;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/files/adapter.ts:50](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/files/adapter.ts#L50)\n\nThe provider that issued the handle (`'openai'`, `'gemini'`, ...).\n\n***\n\n### sizeBytes?\n\n```ts\noptional sizeBytes?: number;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/files/adapter.ts:60](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/files/adapter.ts#L60)\n\nFile size in bytes when the provider reports it.\n\n***\n\n### uri?\n\n```ts\noptional uri?: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/files/adapter.ts:56](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/files/adapter.ts#L56)\n\nThe handle's URL form when the provider exposes one (Gemini file URI, fal\nstorage URL). For providers whose handle is an opaque id (OpenAI,\nAnthropic) this is `undefined`.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: FileHandle\ntitle: FileHandle\n---\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/files/adapter.ts:41](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/files/adapter.ts#L41)\n\nA provider-issued file handle returned by [FilesAdapter.upload](FilesAdapter.md#upload) /\n[FilesAdapter.get](FilesAdapter.md#get). Reference it in a message via a `{ type: 'file' }`\ncontent source — use `fileSourceFromHandle` to build one.\n\n`TProvider` carries the issuing provider's name as a literal (`'openai'`,\n`'gemini'`, ...) when the handle came from a concrete files adapter, so\ncross-provider lifecycle calls (`deleteFile` with a foreign handle) fail at\ncompile time. It defaults to `string` so wire-deserialized handles still fit.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TProvider\n\n`TProvider` *extends* `string` = `string`\n\n## Properties\n\n### expiresAt?\n\n```ts\noptional expiresAt?: number;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/files/adapter.ts:62](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/files/adapter.ts#L62)\n\nExpiry as epoch milliseconds when the handle is scheduled to expire.\n\n***\n\n### filename?\n\n```ts\noptional filename?: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/files/adapter.ts:64](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/files/adapter.ts#L64)\n\nOriginal filename when the provider reports it.\n\n***\n\n### id\n\n```ts\nid: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/files/adapter.ts:48](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/files/adapter.ts#L48)\n\nProvider handle used for lifecycle operations (`get`/`delete`): the\nOpenAI/Anthropic `file_id`, the Gemini file resource name (`files/...`), or\nthe fal storage URL (fal itself has no lifecycle API — the URL doubles as\nthe wire reference).\n\n***\n\n### mimeType?\n\n```ts\noptional mimeType?: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/files/adapter.ts:58](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/files/adapter.ts#L58)\n\nMIME type reported by the provider (or echoed from the upload input).\n\n***\n\n### provider\n\n```ts\nprovider: TProvider;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/files/adapter.ts:50](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/files/adapter.ts#L50)\n\nThe provider that issued the handle (`'openai'`, `'gemini'`, ...).\n\n***\n\n### sizeBytes?\n\n```ts\noptional sizeBytes?: number;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/files/adapter.ts:60](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/files/adapter.ts#L60)\n\nFile size in bytes when the provider reports it.\n\n***\n\n### uri?\n\n```ts\noptional uri?: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/files/adapter.ts:56](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/files/adapter.ts#L56)\n\nThe handle's URL form when the provider exposes one (Gemini file URI, fal\nstorage URL). For providers whose handle is an opaque id (OpenAI,\nAnthropic) this is `undefined`.\n"}
